BigBurger Design Ideas

My plan for this is that I want to create an array of leaving times, and use that to find the wait times. The wait times will be calculated as the start time
for that element minus the leaving time of the element before. The leaving time (with the exception of the first element), will be calculated as max(leaving[i-1],
arrival[i]) + service[i]. There will be a special case for a single element, as that will always be 0. Let's see how we go!

